    "body": "The multiplier itself hot-reloads once the implementation is loaded, but the ASI you tested did not contain the corrected implementation, so changing 999 or 1e-4 could not affect it. The new ASI is installed on disk for the next full restart (D4189A...1AC8); after that, [Misc] MapZoomSpeedMultiplier hot-reloads in about one second and clamps to 1.0-10.0. Moved to \test me.",
